{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9396985f3bccddb46ea3efdfa49616de5c300d90eb9cba343982baa041bf71e1", "ja": "（今回の39プロジェクトのオーディション、\n大勢集まってくれたぞ。さて、次の子は……）", "zh": "（这次的39PROJECT甄选，\n来了许多人报名。好，下一位是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "36fb61be8c17769c8902ae9b6cc3e90ed6a701416126de641d7280171c3381f0", "ja": "はじめまして、北上麗花です。\nよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "你好，我叫做北上丽花。\n请多多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c3d09e66dfc4bd96c82536af62c90b5445afb52ae16dc05d96ca773b053da787", "ja": "（北上麗花さんか。写真よりもずっと可愛いな）", "zh": "（北上丽花是吗？比照片上还要可爱呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "f6748f1838110779b578c0b6310d173a8fc12b839afc3366e3523ce584c4da45", "ja": "カラオケで、友達に歌が上手だと言われたので、\n応募してみました。今日はよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "唱卡拉OK的时候，朋友称赞我唱得很好听，\n所以我就来参加甄选了。今天还请多多指教♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "01c1fe8bcb3979f33c256a37be7b6869b3f8252bcdaa66c2e4ae874f5fc3ea71", "ja": "カラオケか……\nじゃあ、なにか歌ってもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "卡拉OK是吗……\n那么，可以请你唱一小段歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "fab70d5e4fff3fce63f5edd671bf627ffadcdb29e3dc965973c19b9ef027c166", "ja": "はい、いいですよ♪\nではでは聞いてください。", "zh": "好的，没问题哦♪\n那么就请听好啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "f7c6723ddac06a43bc0dea40d1b1a9cf9ebb0b1e902014d482851eb57ae4c8d2", "ja": "作詞、私。作曲、私。『和三盆の歌』です♪\n……コホン！", "zh": "作词，我。作曲，也是我。请听『和三盆之歌』♪\n……咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "4786c095cbd7610a02d9191d5dd05e4ccabfe8569c7481f63f40454a7177d441", "ja": "さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪\nわたしの、和菓子、和三盆～♪", "zh": "一盆、两盆、和三盆～♪\n我的、日式点心、和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0ca7200b95309dad1597553f09d552e969ac3d72ff52247a29a13b34cefcbc44", "ja": "（不思議な歌……だけど、綺麗な声だな。\nそれに、なんて楽しそうに歌うんだろう）", "zh": "（真是奇特的歌……不过，她的歌声的确很美妙。\n而且，她唱得好开心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "e15d3cb8ed7530402946844027e3f05471a24fa27910113a92fdc393e62e44b3", "ja": "さあみなさん、ご一緒に！　せーのっ♪\nさんぼ、わさんぼ～♪", "zh": "大家跟我一起唱！预备──♪\n一盆、两盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5811a1a39e830f3184bf9b4c6194e818aac3d184df03a90de9f08eb9b0577dba", "ja": "和三盆～♪", "zh": "和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "46135da9d58d979d6b0fdabd100602325956665c9bfdafa4f4877eb2da860a8c", "ja": "……はっ。\nつい、歌ってしまった……。", "zh": "……啊。\n我不小心跟着唱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ce2283e8f0b2de3a794955ef61c1d60e84c7e564b46cde730a23fce24730e9a", "ja": "……パチパチパチ～♪　みなさん、とっても\nお上手ですね！　ふふっ、楽しかった～♪", "zh": "……拍拍手～♪大家都唱得很棒哦！\n呵呵，真好玩～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a86a62a22eaba45a680ebdab8ce109b2f6625c6bf05f021843092ce08fd767c1", "ja": "（自作の歌を披露した上、会場にいる\n全員に合唱させるとは、すごい度胸だ……）", "zh": "（不只表演自己写的歌，\n还带动会场的其他人一起合唱，真有胆量……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6e0cbb5ad801d186a0784ddcefb27e58253f1b88152cd0a62a46f09c7c93f763", "ja": "（明るく、清楚そうな見た目もいい。……決めた！）", "zh": "（而且开朗、清秀的外表也很不错……决定了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_2004", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3001_p", "source_sha256": "d15eab4bc776f7647d74c2321236a40c9a1b3cdeacf86d75e1df6584c52f47ff", "ja": "改めてこんにちは、北上麗花さん。\n俺が君のプロデューサーだ、よろしく！", "zh": "又见面了，你好，北上丽花小姐。\n我是你的制作人，请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3002_048rei", "source_sha256": "0156e008667350b2a8d5029a11026158764c2e005a7bc93e58ca2705652015a9", "ja": "あれ……あれあれ？　もしかして、\nオーディション会場でお会いしませんでした？", "zh": "咦……咦咦咦？\n我们是不是在甄选的会场见过呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3003_p", "source_sha256": "38e3ceec677649e9c3098a5007293a1ec9fb8b813c214c735f6fb7253e7332c4", "ja": "ああ、会ってるよ。\n俺が君を推薦したんだ。", "zh": "是啊，我们见过面。\n就是我推荐你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3004_048rei", "source_sha256": "37647abb2d2a6951df6566827d482d3107ecd31b08acce04ba0c5e488ec02f99", "ja": "そうなんですか。\nなんと、プロデューサーさんだったんですね！", "zh": "原来是这样吗？\n原来你是制作人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3005_048rei", "source_sha256": "d85719eb899b15bd58c36a1e1c4e814656c9d2ad71c3e5db23513b03fc7cbec8", "ja": "ビックリです。てっきり、オーディション会場に\n遊びに来た人だと思ってました！", "zh": "真令人吃惊。我还以为\n你只是来甄选会场玩的人而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3006_048rei", "source_sha256": "9231f61e3d6619b4f67e864d26b8e28b24ad5ac971cd2c3f7f6b3e8d95203815", "ja": "それにそれに、プロデューサーっていうからもっと\n偉そうな人だと思ってたのに。地味で普通ですね。", "zh": "而且而且，我以为制作人应该更有排场一点。\n不像你既不起眼又普通呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3007_p", "source_sha256": "28a913cd0ca6703267029dc1324f4b743e1bd4e1b86d232b3a349ebddde0b116", "ja": "そ、そう……。\nプロデューサーには見えなかったかな？", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n我看起来不像个制作人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3008_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f7f833c6f965698ebc8abb30778a61ca6cc9073852264cfcb073f68093fface", "ja": "はい！　どこからどう見ても、\nザ・一般人って感じで、とっても素敵だと思います♪", "zh": "不像！不管怎么看都像个一般人，\n我觉得很棒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3009_p", "source_sha256": "f3880bf102402c7918f0fa869b986af52271acddcf11cdf7fa746ea203dc5144", "ja": "そ、そう……。\n派手なほうがよかったのかな……。", "zh": "是、是哦……\n所以我要穿得气派点比较好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3010_048rei", "source_sha256": "9ef6b12c76a75373b948bdd436fd2495cebdefe8dd9c042397c4d7b0b291774f", "ja": "いえいえ、今のままでバッチリです！\n何事も普通で平凡なのが一番ですよ、ふふっ♪", "zh": "不不不，现在这样最刚好！\n凡事普通又平凡是最棒的哦，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3011_p", "source_sha256": "851ae20a0aaa940d24fa03d0a61bbfa379099d669653d28ca81fbc126c179b76", "ja": "そうか。そうだといいんだけど……。\nとにかく、これからよろしく頼む！", "zh": "是吗？那就好……\n总而言之，以后还请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3012_048rei", "source_sha256": "fca0ef1fcb934aa71bb8339d8ea44c29e75548acf1fc62a4c2881246872624d5", "ja": "はい、よろしく頼まれました！\n私、精一杯頑張ります！", "zh": "好的，我会多多指教！\n努力加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3013_p", "source_sha256": "f915e5d7302895e50d471736831fa8fa7445e2f520ac05b60a2db2d5d998017c", "ja": "（想像以上に変わった子みたいだけど、\n本人に悪気はなさそうだし、これも個性かな）", "zh": "（这女生比我想像中来得奇妙许多，\n但她似乎没有恶意，应该算是一种特色吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_048rei_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_001_3014_p", "source_sha256": "290436970a9b0f97f7d27229072ff6b0afd6ca10e4448f910d214db2ba3d6750", "ja": "（何より魅力的で、大物の予感がする……！\nよし、しっかりプロデュースするぞ！）", "zh": "（她十分有魅力，将来应该大有可为……！\n好，我要好好地培育她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
